    "map_selection": "MapSelect passes gUnk_09EE4BB0 to SetBgMapBlocks with 1 by 2 blocks. The cursor index is explicitly cycled through 0..4 and its row is XORed with 1, proving the separate s16[5] and s16[2] coordinate arrays. func_08093E34 loops i from a to a+9 and indexes gUnk_09EE4BE0[i-a], proving ten u16 tile destinations. The WORLDSELECT Mode is independently identified by its exact ASCII name and the unique ordered triple WORLDSELECT_0/1/2 callbacks in each native ROM."
